# Summary file for mapping the planning cycles and boundaries STP - MTP - LTP - STP for bepicolombo
# This is the reference file used for bepi planning
#
# Created by: Miguel Pérez Ayúcar
# Creation date: 07 March 2025
#
# The data is obtained from scheduler process 
#
# Notes:
#    STP starts nominally on LATE SATURDAY or early SUNDAY 
#       it will be the first WOL after the Ground Station pass on Saturday.
#       This will likely be a WOL in the late hours of Saturday or the early hours on Sunday.
#    There might be specific exceptions agreed beforehand with OGS (such as holidays, MCP, special phases)
#    For Bepi, no VSTP is foreseen
#    LTP boundaries are defined in https://s2e2.cosmos.esa.int/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1152887816
#
#--------------------------------------------------------------
# STP   MTP    #   LTP  STP_start           STP_end 
